[00:00.00] 作曲 : Will Bundy/Lydia Vaughan
[00:10.46] One drink, what's that gonna hurt?
[00:10.46] 一杯酒 能有什么问题
[00:13.96] One dance never killed nobody
[00:13.96] 一支舞 从来无伤大雅
[00:17.42] One kiss just for old time's sake
[00:17.42] 一个吻 只为旧日情谊
[00:21.14] Head back to your place, hands on your body
[00:21.14] 回到你的住处 双手轻抚你身体
[00:24.40]
[00:24.60] Sounds like a good idea when I've been drinkin'
[00:24.60] 微醺时分这主意听来不错
[00:28.33] But when I sober up, I'm thinkin', "What was I thinkin'?"
[00:28.33] 但清醒时总自问 "当时在想什么"
[00:32.21] Climbin' in a last-call cab with you
[00:32.21] 与你共乘末班出租车
[00:35.28] Doin' what I swore I wouldn't do
[00:35.28] 做着曾发誓绝不会做的事
[00:38.69] When the stars are out, boy, I want you to hold me
[00:38.69] 星光闪烁时 渴望你拥抱我
[00:42.23] When the sun comes up, I'm leavin' even more lonely
[00:42.23] 朝阳升起时 却带着更深的寂寞
[00:46.15] I get high, then I'm heartbroke
[00:46.15] 一时沉醉 又心碎
[00:49.20] Gonna love you tonight, gonna hate me tomorrow
[00:49.20] 今夜与你缠绵 明日自我憎厌
[00:53.43]
[00:58.96] A mistake, that's what we've always been
